  "description": "Help Kuky, a curious character who gets lost in the Candy World and must travel through colourful environments to find the way back home. Along the journey, collect candies and face strange sugar-made enemies such as marshmallows, cookies, and other living, dangerous sweets.\n\nUse precise jumps and a double jump to overcome obstacles, avoid traps, and progress through challenging stages full of action and rhythm.\n\nWith fast-paced gameplay, responsive controls, and a charming visual style, Kuky Adventure delivers a fun and addictive platforming experience from start to finish.\n\nFeatures:\n- Precision platforming with dynamic action\n- Double jump to explore and overcome challenges\n- A variety of candy-themed enemies\n- Levels filled with obstacles and traps\n- Colourful and charming visuals\n- Cheerful and engaging soundtrack",
